today?"}, {"start": 17.755, "end": 22.958, "text": "Two prescriptions renewed, Activel and Aromir, if that is all right."}, {"start": 23.939, "end": 24.619, "text": "That is fine."}, {"start": 24.979, "end": 25.56, "text": "Anything else?"}, {"start": 26.56, "end": 29.782, "text": "I am still being treated for asthma and for reflux."}, {"start": 30.718, "end": 31.058, "text": "Noted."}, {"start": 31.398, "end": 32.339, "text": "Both are ongoing."}, {"start": 33.259, "end": 35.68, "text": "Is it a problem that I have been on them for so long?"}, {"start": 36.62, "end": 36.841, "text": "No."}, {"start": 37.141, "end": 38.421, "text": "Your medication is stable."}, {"start": 39.462, "end": 41.642, "text": "Stable meaning it is doing what it should?"}, {"start": 42.563, "end": 42.843, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 43.123, "end": 44.804, "text": "Nothing suggests a change is needed."}, {"start": 46.364, "end": 46.785, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 47.785, "end": 49.906, "text": "I do worry about the asthma sometimes."}, {"start": 50.746, "end": 51.507, "text": "Understandable."}, {"start": 51.927, "end": 53.507, "text": "Today we continue your treatment."}, {"start": 54.508, "end": 56.248, "text": "So you are not concerned about anything?"}, {"start": 57.149, "end": 58.289, "text": "Not from what you have told me."}, {"start": 58.649, "end": 59.87, "text": "Your medication is stable."}, {"start": 60.914, "end": 61.174, "text": "Right."}, {"start": 61.735, "end": 63.036, "text": "Sorry for asking twice."}, {"start": 63.956, "end": 65.057, "text": "It is no trouble at all."}, {"start": 65.998, "end": 67.339, "text": "Which prescriptions will I get?"}, {"start": 68.32, "end": 70.581, "text": "Activel, Aromir, and Isomeprazole."}, {"start": 70.962, "end": 71.842, "text": "All three renewed."}, {"start": 72.823, "end": 75.105, "text": "The Isomeprazole is the one for the reflux?"}, {"start": 76.045, "end": 76.986, "text": "Yes, that is right."}, {"start": 77.967, "end": 78.247, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 78.667, "end": 79.508, "text": "That is what I take."}, {"start": 80.569, "end": 81.75, "text": "Anything else before you go?"}, {"start": 82.75, "end": 83.791, "text": "No, that is everything."}, {"start": 84.271, "end": 87.534, "text": "The supermarket was packed this morning, so I am glad to sit down."}, {"start": 89.221, "end": 90.988, "text": "Everyone seems to shop at the same hour."}, {"start": 91.429, "end": 92.273, "text": "Take care, Cigna."}, {"start": 93.176, "end": 93.919, "text": "Thank you, Doctor."}, {"start": 94.2, "end": 94.641, "text": "Goodbye."}], "machine": "gpu59.int.triton.aalto.fi", "git_commit": "735eed3a1a4f5d8bc8a3ac1f1c8897e291443b9f", "date": "2026-09-20", "timing_s": {"transcribe_and_align": 1.889}}